Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.27,0:21:48.45,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)\an9\fscx90\fscy90}狙いさだめた  指先がさす
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.47,0:21:50.82,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)\an9\fscx90\fscy90}運命は絶望?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.84,0:21:53.42,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)\an9\fscx90\fscy90}それとも希望?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.75,0:21:59.87,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)\an9\fscx90\fscy90}ゆらぎの中で  受信してゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.89,0:22:02.01,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)\an9\fscx90\fscy90}悲しみにも負けない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.03,0:22:04.70,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)\an9\fscx90\fscy90}勇気だけをください
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.17,0:22:10.95,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}大切なもの  守るため
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.02,0:22:16.36,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}「強さ」はあると信じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.38,0:22:22.22,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Saving our future　一緒に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.49,0:22:25.38,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}明日へのドア開いた空へ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.39,0:22:27.84,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}飛び立とう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.99,0:22:33.70,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}とある世界の果てで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.81,0:22:39.46,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}駆け抜けてく　Real Force
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.64,0:22:47.08,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}光を放って!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.27,0:21:48.45,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}那命中注定的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.47,0:21:50.82,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}是絕望?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.84,0:21:53.42,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}還是希望?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.75,0:21:59.87,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}在搖擺中 發送著信息
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.89,0:22:02.01,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}請賜予我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.03,0:22:04.70,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}不會向悲傷低頭的勇氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.17,0:22:10.95,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}為了保護珍貴的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.02,0:22:16.36,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}我相信自己的堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.38,0:22:22.22,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Saving our future  讓我們一同
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.49,0:22:25.38,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}敞開明天的門  向開闊的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.39,0:22:27.84,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}展翅高飛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.99,0:22:33.70,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}向那世界的彼端
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.81,0:22:39.46,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}飛馳而去 Real Force
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.64,0:22:47.08,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}散發出光芒!
